        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrows and Antiquity is an archery speedrunning FPS where mastering unique arrows and uncovering hidden shortcuts will let you conquer trials at breakneck speed. Artemis possesses a legendary bow fit for only a true master of archery. Can you complete her trials?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AIM FOR PERFECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of unique arrows, each with powerful abilities. Discover shortcuts, invent clever tricks, and refine your routes to earn medals and climb the leaderboards! Miss a shot? Restart instantly and chase the perfect run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/9c7a104a7c0016710c04562b69ddeb2e.poster.avif?t=1758245239\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/9c7a104a7c0016710c04562b69ddeb2e.webm?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/9c7a104a7c0016710c04562b69ddeb2e.mp4?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONLINE GHOSTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against ghostly replays of other archers. Learn their routes, shots, and tricks. Then beat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/dc84b30bcbaef2065782bbcf54d6339b.poster.avif?t=1758245239\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/dc84b30bcbaef2065782bbcf54d6339b.webm?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/dc84b30bcbaef2065782bbcf54d6339b.mp4?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>COLLECTABLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for hidden presents and scrolls to unlock game-changing relics. Earn medals to claim rare bows from Artemis’ personal arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/061cc0afd676cda426d238797f14fdb0.poster.avif?t=1758245239\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/061cc0afd676cda426d238797f14fdb0.webm?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/061cc0afd676cda426d238797f14fdb0.mp4?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER ARCHERY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle diverse landscapes with unique challenges. No one has mastered them all. Will you be the first?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/31045939c08ea7b11501a65b7ccca815.poster.avif?t=1758245239\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/31045939c08ea7b11501a65b7ccca815.webm?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310430/extras/31045939c08ea7b11501a65b7ccca815.mp4?t=1758245239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2>",
